msgid "Encryption Handler Notes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/libraries/encryption.rst:254
msgid "OpenSSL Notes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/libraries/encryption.rst:256
msgid ""
"The `OpenSSL <https://www.php.net/openssl>`_ extension has been a "
"standard part of PHP for a long time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/libraries/encryption.rst:258
msgid "CodeIgniter's OpenSSL handler uses the AES-256-CTR cipher."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/libraries/encryption.rst:260
msgid ""
"The *key* your configuration provides is used to derive two other keys, "
"one for encryption and one for authentication. This is achieved by way of"
" a technique known as an `HMAC-based Key Derivation Function "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HKDF>`_ (HKDF)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/libraries/encryption.rst:265
msgid "Sodium Notes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/libraries/encryption.rst:267
msgid ""
"The `Sodium <https://www.php.net/manual/en/book.sodium>`_ extension is "
"bundled by default in PHP as of PHP 7.2.0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/libraries/encryption.rst:270
msgid ""
"Sodium uses the algorithms XSalsa20 to encrypt, Poly1305 for MAC, and "
"XS25519 for key exchange in sending secret messages in an end-to-end "
"scenario. To encrypt and/or authenticate a string using a shared-key, "
"such as symmetric encryption, Sodium uses the XSalsa20 algorithm to "
"encrypt and HMAC-SHA512 for the authentication."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/libraries/encryption.rst:276
msgid "Message Length"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/libraries/encryption.rst:278
msgid ""
"An encrypted string is usually longer than the original, plain-text "
"string (depending on the cipher)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/libraries/encryption.rst:280
msgid ""
"This is influenced by the cipher algorithm itself, the initialization "
"vector (IV) prepended to the cipher-text, and the HMAC authentication "
"message that is also prepended. Furthermore, the encrypted message is "
"also Base64-encoded so that it is safe for storage and transmission "
"regardless of the character-set in use."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/libraries/encryption.rst:285
msgid ""
"Keep this information in mind when selecting your data storage mechanism."
" Cookies, for example, can only hold 4K of information."
msgstr ""

